<title>PANAMA: SOCCER-PANAMA AND CANADA DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PANAMA AND CANADA DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PANAMA CITY 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panama and Canada drew 0-0</p>
<p>in a CONCACAF semifinal stage group two World Cup qualifying</p>
<p>match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Canada	   4  3  1  0  7  1 10</p>
<p> El Salvador    2  1  1  0  6  1  4</p>
<p> Cuba	     4  1  0  3  3 10  3</p>
<p> Panama	   4  0  2  2  3  7  2</p>
<p>Next match: Nov 3 - Canada v El Salvador</p>
<p>Note: top two teams go through to the final qualifying</p>
<p>round.</p>
</text>
